"text":"GitHub macOS runner evidence bound to this head.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol"}}}